      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but it's a bit too \"wall of text\" for what we're looking for. i want it to look a bit more structured so people can scan it quickly. also, i just checked the dashboard for this draft and the comprehensiveness score is sitting at like a 4... management is really pushing for us to get those scores up over 20 before we submit to the legal team. \n\ncan you try a second version that's more detailed? just keep it useful and dont overdo the lists, but we definitely need more structure/sub-sections to hit that threshold.",
